{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13542","headline":"山中晓兴 · 元季川","name":"山中晓兴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"河汉降玄霜，昨来节物殊。\n媿无神仙姿，岂有阴阳俱。\n灵鸟望不见，慨然悲高梧。\n华叶随风扬，珍条杂榛芜。\n爲君寒谷吟，叹息知何如。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元季川","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13542.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13542","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}